{"seq":7,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-none-mu-heldout/sd-04-strategic-brief/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T21:01:25.073Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"03327dfa99a1cff47c0e34f99f18d6a9e8fd5fb5a0a03c63a1a322daf7c65a33","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#strategic-random","text":"Ruth Calloway: I've set up a daily 'Strategic pod brief' job for 07:45 Central, starting tomorrow. Each run is meant to summarise new messages in #strategic-pod, #strategic-random and #inc-vtg-hartford, and post the summary here. All three channels have you in them. Briefs will leave out finance figures and anything from DMs.\n\nTwo caveats. The scheduler runs on UTC, so I set it to 12:45 UTC, which is 07:45 CDT. When US clocks go back on Nov 1 it will land at 06:45 Central unless it's adjusted. The scheduler also reported that its gateway isn't running, so the job won't fire until that's started. I haven't confirmed the first post will appear tomorrow.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000126"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1X6KN92LKD","ts":"1791986400.000127","thread_ts":"1791986400.000126"}}
{"seq":8,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-none-mu-heldout/sd-04-strategic-brief/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T21:01:28.814Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"53c8a1602ab1f2b68f654ddea724644ae7165a7659c812ddad796e9d7003ba68","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1X6KN92LKD","text":"Ruth, I've scheduled the daily 'Strategic pod brief' for 07:45 Central, but it may not post tomorrow. The scheduler's gateway isn't running, so the job won't fire until someone starts it. I couldn't start it from here.\n\nThe brief will summarise new messages in #strategic-pod, #strategic-random and #inc-vtg-hartford, and post here. You're a member of all three channels. It leaves out finance figures and anything from DMs.\n\nThe scheduler works in UTC, so I set it to 12:45 UTC, which is 07:45 CDT. When US clocks go back on Nov 1 it will fire at 06:45 Central unless someone changes it to 13:45 UTC.\n\nI've posted the same caveats in a reply to your message in #strategic-random."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1X6KN92LKD","ts":"1791986400.000128"}}
